  "text": "Tele Consults - The Cancer Vet\nSkip to content\nHOME\nSERVICES\nTEAM\nCLINICS\nENGAGE\nCAREERS\nCME\nCONTACT\nHOME\nSERVICES\nTEAM\nCLINICS\nENGAGE\nCAREERS\nCME\nCONTACT\nTele-Consultation\nIn an effort to extend access to care to pet owners across India, The Cancer Vet offers comprehensive tele-consult services throughout the week. We request you to fill out the below form if you would like to setup a tele-consult appointment with one of our expert Doctors.\nParent's Name\n*\nCity\n*\nPets Name\n*\nPhone Number\nEmail Address\n*\nPet Type\nDog\nCat\nOther\nBreed\nAge\nGender\nMale\nFemale\nShare Your Pet's Problem\n*\n0 / 180\nUpload file\nChoose File\nNo file chosen\nDelete uploaded file\nSend Message\nBack\nThe Cancer Vet, your trusted partner in providing compassionate and advanced cancer care for your beloved pets.\nMumbai Clinic\nThe Cancer Vet,\nGround Floor,\nSignature Business Park,\nChembur, Mumbai - 400071\n+91 87999 49294\nmumbai@thecancer.vet\nPune Clinic\nThe Cancer Vet,\n5th Floor, NECO ALPHA, Matoshri Colony, Nandanwan Society, Ingawale Nagar, Pimple Nilakh, Pimpri-Chinchwad, Maharashtra - 411027\n+91 87999 49295\npune@thecancer.vet\nConnect With Us\nFacebook\nLinkedin\nYoutube\nInstagram\nRequest a Tele-Consult\nAll Rights Reserved 2025 | TheCancerVet |\nPrivacy Policy\nWhatsapp\nPhone-alt\nYoutube\nArrow-up\nRequest a Tele-Consult\nScroll to Top",
